section.social-empower.relative.py-8
    .container
        .section-wrapper(class="flex-center flex-col gap-6")
            .section-header(class="flex-center flex-col gap-6")
                .section-title
                    h2.text-title
                        .text(
                            class="heading-1-subpage text-primary-4 font-bold uppercase"
                        )
                            | EMPOWERING BEL GA ASIA'S PEOPLE

                .section-desc
                    p.text-desc
                        .text(class="body-1 text-Utility-gray-950 text-justify")
                            | People are at the heart of our success. We foster a culture of learning, collaboration, innovation, and continuous improvement, empowering employees to grow professionally and contribute meaningfully to our shared goals. Through talent development, employee engagement and well-being programs, we create an inclusive and supportive workplace where people can thrive, grow, and succeed together.

            .section-content(class="flex-center flex-col gap-6")
                .category(
                    data-category-filter
                    data-filter-target=".section-news-slider"
                )
                    ul.category-list(class="flex flex-wrap gap-5")
                        each item, i in ['All', 'Vietnam', 'Cambodia', 'Myanmar']
                            li.list-item(class="flex-center")
                                a.item(
                                    href="javascript:void(0)"
                                    class=i === 0 ? 'active' : ''
                                    data-category=item
                                )= item

                .section-news-slider.swiper-column-auto.auto-3-column.allow-touchMove.swiper-column-auto-id-2
                    .swiper
                        .swiper-wrapper
                            -for(i=0;i<3;i++)
                                .swiper-slide(
                                    data-filter="Vietnam"
                                )
                                    .news-card(
                                        class="h-full flex flex-col bg-Utility-white rounded-3 overflow-hidden"
                                    )
                                        .card-img
                                            .img-wrapper
                                                .img(
                                                    class="img-ratio ratio:pt-[280_440]"
                                                )
                                                    +PugImg()

                                        .card-content
                                            .card-meta
                                                p.country
                                                    .text(
                                                        class="body-3 text-primary-1"
                                                    )
                                                        | Vietnam

                                            .card-title
                                                h3.text-title
                                                    .text(
                                                        class="heading-3 text-primary-1 font-bold"
                                                    )
                                                        | Talent Management and Retention Program

                    .swiper-button-wrapper
                        .btn-prev
                            +ArrowButton()

                        .btn-next
                            +ArrowButton()(class="rotate-180")